<title>USA: Strong winds threaten NE Atlantic, N.Sea shipping.</title>
<headline>Strong winds threaten NE Atlantic, N.Sea shipping.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, MASS. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Strong winds cover much of the northeast Atlantic and the northern North Sea at this time, independent forecaster Weather Services Corp said.</p>
<p>Shipping in this area is at risk due to high winds and very rough seas.</p>
</text>
